    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS ULIMEK?</h2>Ulimek is a fast-paced platformer where you dash through the levels as fast (or as chill) as you like using a similar hookshot mechanic.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2>Ulimek, forced to leave her village after the Aswang attacked, embarks on a quest to rescue her captured father, unravel her true self, help other villages, and learn what it takes to be a Babaylan (shaman) along the way. Find the cure for the curse that befell the land, defeat the monsters, free their spirits, and uncover the mystery of the missing people!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 2D pixel art<br></li><li> Clear the room in a satisfying manner<br></li><li> Hook, dash, and latch onto enemies<br></li><li> Bring peace to lost spirits along the way<br></li><li> Harness the power of the spirits<br></li><li> Meet new people and help other villages<br></li><li> A story of self-discovery</li></ul>",
